# Keep ux_capture out of published wheels and sdists.
# Rationale: ux_capture/ wires Pilot to the real ServonautApp. Including it
# in the published package would let any installer drive the app
# headlessly — including SSH, SCP, and IP-ban actions if real services
# get plugged in. It is a dev/CI tool only. Do NOT remove this exclusion
# without re-reading textual-pilot-mcp/SECURITY.md.
prune ux_capture
recursive-exclude ux_capture *
